<title>FRANCE: Alcatel wins one bln Ffr of contracts.</title>
<headline>Alcatel wins one bln Ffr of contracts.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French telecommunications group Alcatel Telecom said on Thursday it has won contracts worth around one billion francs ($192.1 million) in Thailand and Vietnam.</p>
<p>Alcatel Telecom is a unit of engineering group Alcatel Alsthom. ($ = 5.206 French Francs)</p>
</text>
